From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PANP2010 <18610364979@163.com>
Date: Fri, 29 May 2026 02:56:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] nebula: /nebula hash + structural variant for DG1 smoke
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add NebulaCommand.hash(structural=true|false) wired as
  /nebula hash and /nebula hash structural.
- Add NebulaServerReplayScheduler.computeStateHash(boolean
  excludeTimeVarying) — structural variant omits gameTime,
  dayClock, weather to allow cross-restart determinism smoke
  without wall-clock drift masking real divergence.
- Smoke harness verified: two boots from the same on-disk
  snapshot produce identical structural digest
  6b10fbf5...e67e1 (arch §12.1 / DG1 partial).

